WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.840
Hello, little coder! Today you will tell a cat where to go — with arrows!

2
00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:08.730
Each arrow block moves the cat.

3
00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:11.000
The right arrow moves right.

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:13.250
The up arrow moves up.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.990
One arrow block moves one square.

6
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:18.540
Two blocks move two squares.

7
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.140
Put blocks in a row to make a script.

8
00:00:21.140 --> 00:00:24.300
The cat does them in order, one after another.

9
00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.640
Press Run to watch the cat follow your blocks.

10
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:30.250
Help the cat get to the star.

11
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:35.130
Three right arrows — the cat got the star!

12
00:00:35.130 --> 00:00:37.680
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

13
00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.030
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
